msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບເຊີບເວີ NFS ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. Translators: 2nd part of error message (1st one is 'No nfs servers have been found ...)
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:361
msgid ""
"\n"
"This could be caused by a running firewall,\n"
"which probably blocks the network scanning."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ນີ້ອາດຈະເກີດຈາກໄຟວໍທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່,\n"
"ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບລັອກການສະແກນເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. heading for a directory selection dialog
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:388
msgid "Select the Mount Point"
msgstr "ເລືອກຈຸດເມົາທ໌"

#. help text 1/4
#. change: locally defined -> servers on LAN
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:435
msgid ""
"<p>Enter the <b>NFS Server Hostname</b>.  With\n"
"<b>Choose</b>, browse through a list of\n"
"NFS servers on the local network.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ປ້ອນ <b>ຊື່ໂຮສຕ໌ເຊີບເວີ NFS</b>. ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ\n"
"<b>ເລືອກ</b>, ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຂອງ\n"
"ເຊີບເວີ NFS ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທ້ອງຖິ່ນ.</p>\n"

#. help text 2/4
#. added "Select" button
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:444
msgid ""
"<p>In <b>Remote File System</b>,\n"
"enter the path to the directory on the NFS server.  Use\n"
"<b>Select</b> to select one from those exported by the server.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນ <b>ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທາງໄກ</b>,\n"
"ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນເຊີບເວີ NFS. ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ\n"
"<b>ເລືອກ</b> ເພື່ອເລືອກອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງທີ່ເຊີບເວີສົ່ງອອກມາ.\n"
"</p>"

#. help text 3/4
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:454
msgid ""
"<p>\t\t\n"
"For <b>Mount Point</b>, enter the path in the local file system where the "
"directory should be mounted. With\n"
"<b>Browse</b>, select your mount point\n"
"interactively.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\t\t\n"
"ສຳລັບ <b>ຈຸດເມົາທ໌</b>, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຄວນຈະຖືກເມົາທ໌. ດ້ວຍ\n"
"<b>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ</b>, ເລືອກຈຸດເມົາທ໌ຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"ແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ.</p>"

#. help text 4/4
#: src/include/nfs/ui.rb:465
msgid ""
"<p>For a list of <b>Options</b>,\n"
"read the man page mount(8).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຂອງ <b>ຕົວເລືອກ</b>,\n"
"ໃຫ້ອ່ານໜ້າ man page mount(8).</p>"

